   124	The page must answer each of the following:
   125	
   126	1. How do I know which bariatric procedure is right for me?
   127	2. Is bariatric surgery available on Medicare or private health insurance?
   128	3. What is the difference between a gastric sleeve and a gastric bypass?
   129	4. Do I have to have surgery, or are there non-surgical options?
   130	5. What does aftercare involve, and why does it matter so much?
   131	6. Where will my surgery and appointments take place?
   132	7. I have had weight loss surgery before — can it be revised?
