docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/bariatric-surgery-perth.md:333:> Aftercare can include surgeon reviews, blood tests, dietitian support, supplements where prescribed and help adapting eating. Over 10 years, experiences vary: some people maintain changes, some regain weight, develop nutritional issues or need further treatment. No single 10-year result can be promised, so ongoing follow-up remains important.
